{"uid":"5d58ed19ba96e43a","name":"test_absent_index_cache_still_builds_when_a_valid_legacy_index_scan_stays_expensive","fullName":"tests.test_hub_real_render_cap_whole_call#test_absent_index_cache_still_builds_when_a_valid_legacy_index_scan_stays_expensive","historyId":"d5d27c8ca977bf0069b15213e578c2e8","time":{"start":1791959467532,"stop":1791959470123,"duration":2591},"description":"Task cure-01-04 (PRD C.4, DoD 3): a review finding at\n    22280f71-and-earlier -- the `legacy-collapse-only-second` cases of\n    `test_indexed_and_second_tails_are_bounded` read 12,115,529 transcript\n    bytes on BOTH the first AND the second same-iteration/same-size call,\n    because `ui_server._absent_index_cache_store` skipped building its\n    cache purely because this iteration's own `collapse_index.json` was\n    valid -- a proxy for \"the scan was cheap\" that PRD Q's own silent-\n    prelude fixture (also written WITH a valid `collapse_index.json`)\n    falsifies: its outer growth loop still has to grow all the way to the\n    FULL-ask bound to resolve, reading nearly the whole transcript\n    regardless. Fails at 22280f71 (second call measured over 12.1M\n    bytes); this task's cure keys the skip on whether THIS scan actually\n    needed that full-ask bound (`_fetch_live_tail`/`_fetch_dead_tail`'s\n    own new third return value), not on the legacy index's mere\n    presence, so the cache still gets built and the second call is\n    bounded.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task cure-01-04 (PRD C.4, DoD 3): a review finding at<br />\n22280f71-and-earlier -- the <code>legacy-collapse-only-second</code> cases of<br />\n<code>test_indexed_and_second_tails_are_bounded</code> read 12,115,529 transcript<br />\nbytes on BOTH the first AND the second same-iteration/same-size call,<br />\nbecause <code>ui_server._absent_index_cache_store</code> skipped building its<br />\ncache purely because this iteration's own <code>collapse_index.json</code> was<br />\nvalid -- a proxy for &quot;the scan was cheap&quot; that PRD Q's own silent-<br />\nprelude fixture (also written WITH a valid <code>collapse_index.json</code>)<br />\nfalsifies: its outer growth loop still has to grow all the way to the<br />\nFULL-ask bound to resolve, reading nearly the whole transcript<br />\nregardless. Fails at 22280f71 (second call measured over 12.1M<br />\nbytes); this task's cure keys the skip on whether THIS scan actually<br />\nneeded that full-ask bound (<code>_fetch_live_tail</code>/<code>_fetch_dead_tail</code>'s<br />\nown new third return value), not on the legacy index's mere<br />\npresence, so the cache still gets built and the second call is<br />\nbounded.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791959389075,"stop":1791959389075,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791959389076,"stop":1791959389076,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791959467507,"stop":1791959467507,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791959467507,"stop":1791959467518,"duration":11},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791959467519,"stop":1791959467525,"duration":6},"status":